+/* Speak a UTF-8 string through the board's audio device.
+ *
+ * Pipeline: active TTS backend -> 16 kHz mono PCM -> audio_playback_write().
+ * Long text is split at punctuation so each TTS round trip stays inside the
+ * response budget; chunks are synthesized and played one after another.
